# Song-screen ARP is the DJ. The first bar of a phrase stays dry. The next can
# hold one ride for two bars. The last bar punctuates, then lets go.
# Seed 0xA5C3, turned on during bar 0: the ride is the transient, then the
# sixteenth gate. GLO's ARP is still the arpeggiator. The sequence screen's
# ARP is still back. OCT- is back on the song screen.
seed 42
reboot
wait 40
expect iamdj 0
expect iamarp 0
expect litbtn 1024
tap ARP
expect toast DJ
expect toast2 ON
expect iamdj 1
expect iamarp 0
expect litbtn 1280
expect iamdjfx 0
expect iamdjbit 0
expect iamdjkn 0
expect fxmask 0
expect djmask 0
tap ARP
expect toast DJ
expect toast2 OFF
expect iamdj 0
expect litbtn 1024
expect iamdjfx 0
tap ARP
expect iamdj 1
expect toast2 ON
# Bar 1, and the bar after it: one crowd move, the transient. The knobs stay put.
barwait
expect iamdj 1
expect iamdjbit 4
expect djmask 8
expect iamdjfx 0
expect iamdjkn 0
expect fxmask 0
expect iamdly 0
expect iamhel 0
barwait
expect iamdjbit 4
expect djmask 8
expect iamdjfx 0
expect fxmask 0
# The last bar of the four: the sixteenth gate, and nothing else.
barwait
expect iamdjfx 17
expect fxmask 65536
expect iamdjbit 0
expect djmask 0
expect iamdjkn 0
# The first bar of the next four is dry. The DJ stays on.
barwait
expect iamdj 1
expect iamdjfx 0
expect iamdjbit 0
expect iamdjkn 0
expect fxmask 0
expect djmask 0
# Letting go is immediate.
tap ARP
expect toast DJ
expect toast2 OFF
expect iamdj 0
expect iamdjfx 0
expect fxmask 0
expect djmask 0
expect litbtn 1024

# The sequence screen keeps ARP as back. The DJ stays on.
seed 42
reboot
wait 40
tap ARP
expect iamdj 1
tap SEQ
expect iamseq 1
tap ARP
expect toast BAR: BACK
expect iamdj 1
expect iamarp 0
expect iamseq 1

# GLO keeps the arpeggiator. Coming back leaves the DJ on and the move down.
seed 42
reboot
wait 40
tap ARP
expect iamdj 1
tap GLO
expect iam 0
tap ARP
expect iamarp 1
expect iamdj 1
expect toast ARP
expect toast2 ON
tap GLO
expect iam 1
expect iamarp 0
expect iamdj 1
expect iamdjfx 0
expect iamdjbit 0
expect iamdjkn 0
expect toast JAM
expect toast2 PLAYGROUND
